      "path": "concepts/cf-cell-methods.md",
      "sha256": "77aabf42e0656f599f5627b69e612870531d5e7b27b7fdb9327e41d704c05d0b",
      "reason": "The analysis uses intensive tracer fields and extensive grid variables (`areacello`, `volcello`), so the distinction between weighted means for intensive variables and sums of extensive quantities constrains the calculations.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "`dissic`, `talk`, and `ph` are `area: mean where sea time: mean`; treat the monthly CMIP6 fields as monthly means and form the 2002 annual mean (and the 1971-2000 average for `dissic`) from those time means before spatial analysis."
      ]
    },
